      "title": "ju lutem, S'ka gjë",
      "text": "Ju lutem is \"please\" (word for word, \"I ask you\"). S'ka gjë is what you say after \"thank you\": word for word \"there is nothing\", so \"no problem\". Albanians often add the first name when they greet a neighbour: Mirëmëngjes, Drita.",
